#   * unsupported dtype / mismatched shapes -> eager generic expression;
#   * capture unavailable or raising        -> graphs disabled, eager affine;
#   * input buffers not stable across calls -> never captured (eager);
#   * captured graph slower than eager      -> graphs disabled for good.
